    "description": "SkyReels V3 A2V with CFG-Parallel=2 at guidance=5.0. The three-branch A2V CFG (conditional, drop-text, unconditional) is distributed across 2 GPUs (rank 0 handles 2 branches, rank 1 handles 1) for a measured ~1.44x speedup vs single-GPU CFG. Required guidance>1.0 to exercise the CFG code path; at the default guidance=1.0 CFG is disabled and the second GPU sits idle (identical latency to single-device baseline).",
    "server_type": "vllm-omni",
    "server_params": {
      "model": "Skywork/SkyReels-V3-A2V-19B",
      "serve_args": {
        "cfg-parallel-size": 2,
        "enable-diffusion-pipeline-profiler": true
      }
    },
